[2026-11-16T09:17:38.948Z] [requirements-st-b1522d] [stop=end_turn] [response] {"thought":"Continue the security constraints with S-06 through S-08.","action":{"tool":"edit_file","input":{"path":".xcoder/backlog/requirements-st-b1522d.md","old_str":"INSERT_HERE","new_str":"- S-06 [AI-05/PRM-04] Workspace sandbox: reject absolute paths, dot-dot traversal, disallowed path components and any resolved path escaping the workspace root. Exclude hidden names, generated directories (node_modules, dist, build, .venv, __pycache__) and credential-shaped filenames (.env*, *.pem, *.key, id_rsa*, *.pfx, credentials*, secrets*). Run a belt-and-braces secret-pattern scan on file contents returned to the model.\n- S-07 [AI-03] Human approval for high-impact actions: writing or overwriting files, and launching an agent run, each require explicit in-UI confirmation naming the concrete target. Destructive or out-of-workspace actions are refused outright, not approved.\n- S-08 [AI-04] Sandboxed execution: project run processes spawn with the workspace as cwd, no shell interpolation of model-supplied strings, a timeout, a visible Stop control and per-run output caps.\n- S-09 [AI-02] User-scoped permissions: the agent inherits the desktop user filesystem rights only; no elevation and no shared service identity.\nINSERT_HERE"}}}
