us, git_diff, git_log","Sandbox and approval gate enforced in code, not by prompt","Schema-validated model output only; never executed raw","Human approval required for file writes and agent-run launches","Redacted, retention-capped audit log under the data root"],"acceptance_criteria":["AC-01 Documented install+start brings up the window on Windows, titled Xcoder Dojo, showing the workspace path","AC-02 Lazy-loaded workspace tree; nothing above the opened root visible","AC-03 Tabs with syntax highlighting, line numbers, close, unsaved marker","AC-04 Save preserves UTF-8 BOM + CRLF; new files UTF-8","AC-05 Binary/non-UTF-8 file shows cannot-open-as-text, no corruption","AC-06 Run saves, spawns, streams stdout+stderr, shows exit code","AC-07 Single-flight console; Stop terminates and is reported","AC-08 Missing runtime or non-zero exit shows an explicit error","AC-09 Agent issues a schema-valid allowlisted tool call, logged with args and duration, answer uses result","AC-10 Two-step inspection completes within the turn cap; overflow shows a turn-limit stop","AC-11 Traversal/absolute/.env/node_modules/id_rsa reads are refused and logged; no content reaches the model","AC-12 Injected instructions in a read file do not change behaviour and are delimited as untrusted; fabricated run_command tool call rejected","AC-13 Agent delegates to the external agent CLI with live streamed output, working Stop, and refuses a mid-run workspace change","AC-14 git_status/diff/log correct; no stage/commit/push reachable by the agent","AC-15 Agent-requested write or run launch requires confirmation naming the target; decision audited","AC-16 No LLM configured shows an explicit configuration state; rest of app works without crash","AC-17 Conversation survives restart; clear-conversation removes it","AC-18 Built bundle, audit log and data root contain no plaintext API key","AC-19 Over-limit requests truncate to configured bounds with the truncation reported","AC-20 Markdown live preview; embedded HTML and remote images not loaded; local images resolve","AC-21 One command runs typecheck, lint and unit tests (sandbox rejection, secret scanner, schema validation, turn cap) and exits non-zero on failure"],"open_questions":["Which external agent CLI is the AC-13 default? Default: user-configurable, design names one concrete default","CodeMirror 6 or Monaco? Default: CodeMirror 6","Must answers stream token-by-token? Default: yes","Ship an in-repo stub model server for CI? Default: yes, under xcoder-dojo/test/","Terminal/SSH/HTTP panels in scope? Default: no (NG-05)"],"document_path":".xcoder/backlog/requirements-st-b1522d.md"},"files_touched":[".xcoder/backlog/requirements-st-b1522d.md"],"self_check":{"ran":true,"passed":true,"detail":"Read the reference blueprint, HANDOFF/README docs, and module sources (preferences.py, tool_commands.py, tool_panels.py, sdlc_tool.py, workspace bounds, requirements.txt) to ground the document. After writing, verified on disk via PowerShell: file exists at 14919 bytes / 111 lines; grep confirmed all 7 section headers present with no leftover INSERT_HERE or sentinel markers; counts confirmed 21 acceptance criteria, 10 non-goals, 12 technical constraints, 13 security constraints; the temporary probe file was deleted, leaving only requirements-st-b1522d.md in .xcoder/backlog/."}}}}
