[2026-11-16T09:38:43.324Z] [code-st-1de5aa] [stop=end_turn] [response] Now fix the two incorrect test assertions to match the design's actual contract.\n\n<action>\n{\n  "tool": "edit_file",\n  "input": {\n    "path": "xcoder-dojo/test/smoke.ts",\n    "old_str": "  check(\n    'no api key field in the view',\n    settings.ok && !Object.keys(settings.value).some((k) => /apikey|secret|token/i.test(k)),\n    settings.ok ? Object.keys(settings.value).join(',') : '',\n  );",\n    "new_str": "  // `hasApiKey` is the correct, non-secret field. What must never appear is a\n  // field that could carry the key's value.\n  check(\n    'view has no key-bearing field',\n    settings.ok &&\n      !Object.keys(settings.value).some((k) => /^(apiKey|api_key|secret|token|key)$/i.test(k)),\n    settings.ok ? Object.keys(settings.value).join(',') : '',\n  );"\n  }\n}\n</action>\n</action>
