[2026-11-16T09:45:28.994Z] [code-st-1de5aa] [stop=end_turn] [response] Final verification complete. CSS headers clean, build passes, all 40 runtime assertions pass.\n\n<action>\n{\n  "tool": "final_answer",\n  "input": {\n    "summary": "Built `xcoder-dojo/` as a complete, working TypeScript UI IDE implementing the design in `.xcoder/backlog/design-st-2c7624.md` — a Vite + React 18 + TypeScript (strict) app with all 24 specified surfaces (P-00 shell through P-12 error center) and a real backend that enforces every security property in code.\n\n**Architecture (three layers):**\n- `src/contracts/` — the shared contract layer: closed `AppErrorCode` vocabulary, `BridgeResult`, the `ActionDescriptor` with its non-optional `requiresApproval`, all page models, and the complete `DojoBridge` surface (no `ipcRenderer` passthrough).\n- `src/backend/` — the privileged layer: path sandbox, virtual workspace filesystem, the 11-tool allowlist dispatcher, sanitizing Markdown parser, redacted append-only audit log, write-only secret store, deterministic agent engine, and the bridge that wires them together.\n- `src/ui/` — the pages, a provider holding page models, and ten layered stylesheets with three themes.\n\n**Security properties actually implemented and asserted (not just typed):** path-escape/credential/excluded-dir refusals; closed tool allowlist checked before dispatch; AST-only Markdown with block+inline HTML stripped and images blocked; approval gate on exactly two actions with expiry and stale-ID rejection; single-flight run console; no getter anywhere that returns the API key; redaction at audit write time; engine text escaped and labelled, tool cards built from backend records so injection cannot forge UI.\n\n**Notable fix found by testing:** the Markdown parser was letting inline HTML tags through as literal text. The smoke suite caught it (2 failing assertions), I hardened the parser to strip inline HTML and count it, and re-ran to 40/40 green.\n\n**One environment gotcha worth flagging:** an external file-versioning layer prepends a `//` header to files on write, which is invalid CSS and broke `vite build`. I stripped those headers from every stylesheet and the build is clean. Any future write to a `.css` file in this workspace will reintroduce it — worth knowing for later tasks.",\n    "deliverable": {\n      "path": "xcoder-dojo/",\n      "stack": "Vite 5 + React 18 + TypeScript 5 (strict, noEmit)",\n      "scripts": {\n        "dev": "vite",\n        "build": "tsc --noEmit && vite build",\n        "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",\n        "test": "esbuild test/smoke.ts --bundle --platform=node --format=esm --outfile=test/smoke.mjs && node test/smoke.mjs"\n      },\n      "pages_implemented": [\n        "P-00 App Shell",\n        "P-01 Welcome / No-Workspace",\n        "P-02 Workspace Explorer",\n        "P-03 Editor Area (+P-03a text pane, P-03b markdown preview, P-03c unopenable state)",\n        "P-04 Run Console (+P-04a target picker)",\n        "P-05 Agent Panel / JARVIS (+P-05a tool cards, P-05b turn-limit, P-05c model-not-configured)",\n        "P-06 Delegation Run View",\n        "P-07 Approval Sheet",\n        "P-08 Settings (+P-08a Model & Limits, P-08b Data/Secrets/Audit, P-08c Appearance)",\n        "P-09 Conversation History",\n        "P-10 Audit Log Viewer",\n        "P-11 Status Bar",\n        "P-12 Error Center"\n      ],\n      "security_enforcement_map": {\n        "path sandbox": "src/backend/sandbox.ts",\n        "closed tool allowlist": "src/backend/tools.ts",\n        "sanitized markdown (AST only)": "src/backend/markdown.ts",\n        "approval gate (file-write, delegation-launch)": "src/backend/demo-bridge.ts",\n        "single-flight console": "src/backend/demo-bridge.ts",\n        "write-only API key": "src/backend/store.ts",\n        "redacted append-only audit": "src/backend/audit.ts",\n        "escaped model output + backend-built tool cards": "src/ui/pages/TranscriptView.tsx, src/ui/components/ToolCard.tsx"\n      },\n      "verification": {\n        "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit exits 0",\n        "build": "tsc --noEmit && vite build exits 0 (65 modules, 219 kB JS / 19 kB CSS)",\n        "runtime_tests": "40/40 assertions pass"\n      }\n    },\n    "files_touched": [\n      "xcoder-dojo/package.json",\n      "xcoder-dojo/tsconfig.json",\n      "xcoder-dojo/vite.config.ts",\n      "xcoder-dojo/index.html",\n      "xcoder-dojo/README.md",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/main.tsx",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/contracts/index.ts",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/contracts/errors.ts",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/contracts/action.ts",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/contracts/bridge.ts",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/contracts/models-workspace.ts",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/contracts/models-execution.ts",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/contracts/models-delegation.ts",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/contracts/models-settings.ts",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/backend/vfs.ts",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/backend/sandbox.ts",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/backend/markdown.ts",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/backend/audit.ts",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/backend/store.ts",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/backend/tools.ts",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/backend/agent-engine.ts",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/backend/demo-bridge.ts",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/ui/store.tsx",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/ui/AppProvider.tsx",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/ui/App.tsx",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/ui/components/MarkdownView.tsx",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/ui/components/SyntaxEditor.tsx",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/ui/components/StatusBar.tsx",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/ui/components/ErrorCenter.tsx",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/ui/components/Explorer.tsx",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/ui/components/ToolCard.tsx",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/ui/pages/WelcomePage.tsx",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/ui/pages/EditorPage.tsx",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/ui/pages/RunConsolePage.tsx",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/ui/pages/AgentPanel.tsx",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/ui/pages/TranscriptView.tsx",\n      "xcoder-dojo/src/ui/pages/Delegati